<title>JAPAN: Tokatsu Foods - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokatsu Foods - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 21.94		vs	   20.59</p>
<p> Operating	    8 million	 vs	  604 million</p>
<p> Current	     48 million	 vs	  511 million</p>
<p> Net		   29 million	 vs	  265 million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.76 yen	  vs	   15.82 yen</p>
<p> Shares		17 million	 vs	   17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokatsu Foods Co Ltd is a manufacturer and distributor of bread, prepared meals, sushi and other foods.</p>
